---
description: dex-trades-canonical conventions
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Secrets only via `DEX_` env vars (`DEX_ETH_RPC_URL`, `DEX_BASE_RPC_URL`). Never put keys in YAML.
- Alchemy Free: `chunk_size: 10` for eth_getLogs.
- Canonical trade grain and noise flags (`is_dust`, `is_self_churn`, `is_clean`) live in dbt `int_dex_trades`.
- English only in committed text.
- Do not commit `data/`, `warehouse/`, or `.env`.
- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits/PRs.
- Do not use `--trailer` for Cursor co-authors.
